# Pinned SHA-256 digests of the upstream rsync release tarballs CI builds or
# reads. tools/ci/fetch_upstream_rsync.sh refuses any tarball whose digest does
# not match its line here, and the fetch-upstream-rsync action keys its cache on
# this file, so a new pin is one line and invalidates nothing else.
#
# Format: sha256sum(1) output - "<sha256>  rsync-<version>.tar.gz".
#
# How each digest was obtained (2026-09-25):
#   1. Downloaded https://download.samba.org/pub/rsync/src/rsync-<v>.tar.gz and
#      its detached signature rsync-<v>.tar.gz.asc to files (no pipe).
#   2. gpg --verify reported a Good signature for every tarball, from:
#        2.6.9 3.0.9 3.1.3 3.2.7  Wayne Davison
#                                 0048C8B026D4C96F0E589C2F6C859FB14B96A8C5
#        3.4.1 3.4.4 3.5.0        Andrew Tridgell
#                                 9FEF112DCE19A0DC7E882CB81BB24997A8535F6F
#        3.5.1                    Andrew Tridgell (as above) and Zen Dodd
#                                 8EDF88F4731A1E8B45D67FBE6909546B2C52EC2D
#      Keys fetched from keyserver.ubuntu.com by full fingerprint.
#   3. gzip -t passed, then shasum -a 256 produced the digests below.
# samba.org publishes no .sha files; the signature is the upstream attestation.
# The fallback source, https://www.mirrorservice.org/sites/rsync.samba.org/src,
# was downloaded the same way and matched every digest below byte for byte.
#
# To add a version: repeat steps 1-3 and append its line.
ca437301becd890e73300bc69a39189ff1564baa761948ff149b3dd7bde633f9  rsync-2.6.9.tar.gz
30f10f8dd5490d28240d4271bb652b1da7a60b22ed2b9ae28090668de9247c05  rsync-3.0.9.tar.gz
55cc554efec5fdaad70de921cd5a5eeb6c29a95524c715f3bbf849235b0800c0  rsync-3.1.3.tar.gz
4e7d9d3f6ed10878c58c5fb724a67dacf4b6aac7340b13e488fb2dc41346f2bb  rsync-3.2.7.tar.gz
2924bcb3a1ed8b551fc101f740b9f0fe0a202b115027647cf69850d65fd88c52  rsync-3.4.1.tar.gz
bd88cf82fa653da32314fb229136407c5c90f80d1758d8f4b091767877d8fa96  rsync-3.4.4.tar.gz
c7ffd1ef653e99540f661e47cb00b7f9cad1ee6b972399b16f93d672656e0d33  rsync-3.5.0.tar.gz
c55f9c9dc10fb8bec397b399a0fdded53cc9a2d8e30891bb0d63724d25c37bef  rsync-3.5.1.tar.gz
